					note = "From the south, walk up into the camp below the violet dome of {area:279}. {npc:2411}, {npc:2412} and {npc:2413} (33-34) stand together in the camp, {npc:2414} (35) a little west of them; each carries one Bloodstone piece. The Shield Guards and Theurgists (31-33) around them drop the Worn Stone Tokens: the ones on the camp's west side are furthest from the Guard's road.\nCareful: Kirin Tor Guards (55) attack the Horde on sight, and one of them patrols the road that comes down into the camp from the north-east and walks right up to the traitors: he has killed many players here. Watch for him, let him walk back up the road, then pull the traitors. Many of the camp's guards stand in linked pairs and others patrol alone. Arcane Sentries (55, elite) and Kirin Tor Enforcers (55) stand around the violet dome itself: keep to the camp below the rim.",
